ARP support files for Aztec C 5.0a
----------------------------------

Compiled by Bill Barton (bix: peabody)


directories:
    lib     - contains object modules and libraries
    include - include files
    src     - source code to libraries
    tools   - handy tools

lib
    contents:
	arp*.lib     - full ARP glue + ARPified c.lib functions + ARP
		       startup.

	a*.lib	     - ARP glue only (no startup, no c.lib functions).

	gads.o*      - GADS() implementation of _cli_parse() for ARP
		       argument template processing.

	arpdetach.o* - ARP version of detach.o*.

    model:
	*.lib	 - small code/data, 32 bit ints
	*16.lib  - small code/data, 16 bit ints
	*l.lib	 - large code/data, 32 bit ints
	*16l.lib - large code/data, 16 bit ints

	*.oss	 - small code/data, 16 bit ints
	*.ols	 - small code/data, 32 bit ints
	*.osl	 - large code/data, 16 bit ints
	*.oll	 - large code/data, 32 bit ints


include/libraries
    arpbase.h - new version of arpbase.h compatible w/ Aztec C v5.0a.

    arp.p     - Arp #pragmas for inline function calls.  This file is
		accessed by arpbase.h.	These #pragmas are compatible
		with both Lattice C 5.0 and Aztec C 5.0a.

src
    arp_lib.fd	- new ARP .FD file (has a couple of bug fixes)
    clihelp.c	- default CLIHelp string
    cliparse.c	- non-GADS (default) version of _cli_parse()
    clitemp.c	- default CLITemplate string
    crt0.asm	- Aztec C startup code
    dospkt.c	- ARP implementation of Aztec function dospkt()
    exit.c	- Aztec C exit code
    fmalloc.c	- ARP implementation of malloc(), etc.
    fprintf.asm - FPrintf() glue
    gads.c	- GADS version of _cli_parse()
    printf.asm	- Printf() glue
    scdir.c	- ARP implementation of scdir()
    sprintf.asm - SPrintf() glue
    toupper.asm - Toupper() glue
    tracker.asm - resource tracking functions glue
    vars.c	- Aztec C globals
    _main.c	- Aztec C startup code
    _exit.c	- Aztec C exit code

tools
    bind     - program to generate glue libraries from an .fd file.
    bindfile - rule file for use with bind.

